return ['domain'=>'zinn-offload','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-offload','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:46+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:46+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Media Offload'=>'Zinn® Media Offload','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload','Moves this site\'s media library to Zinn® object storage and serves it from a CDN. Configured from your Zinn® dashboard — no access key is ever typed into WordPress.'=>'Boggan maktabadiisa warbaahinta waxay u guurineysaa keydinta shayada Zinn® waxayna ka soo adeegaysaa CDN. Laga soo habeeyey guddigaaga Zinn® — ma jiro furaha gelitaanka ee abid lagu qoro WordPress.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Keydsan. Ku qor qiime cusub si aad u bedesho.','Filter this list…'=>'Sifee liiskan…','Filter this list'=>'Sifee liiskan','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Waxba kuma habboona miirahaas.','Add a row'=>'Ku dar saf','Remove this row'=>'Ka saar safkan','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — dulmar','Overview'=>'Guud mar','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Plugin kasta oo Zinn® ah oo ku yaala boggan, iyo inuu shaqaynayo iyo in kale.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Xiriir looma baahna furahan.','Open settings'=>'Fur dejinta','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ma haysatid ogolaansho aad ku beddesho dejimahan.','Settings sections'=>'Qaybaha dejinta','Support'=>'Taageero','Save changes'=>'Kaydi isbeddellada','Tools'=>'Qalabka','Export settings'=>'Dhoofinta dejinta','Reset to defaults'=>'Ku celi sidii hore','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Tani waxay soo celinaysaa dhammaan dejinta plugin-kan sidii loogu talagalay asalka. Ma rabtaa inaad sii waddo?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Baaritaannada taageerada','Import a settings file'=>'Soo dejiso faylka dejinta','Import'=>'Soo dejiso','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faylasha la dhoofiyay waligood ma kooban yihiin eray-siraha, calaamadaha (tokens) ama furayaasha API-ga — waxaad u baahan doontaa inaad kuwan dib u geliso bogga cusub.','Settings saved.'=>'Dejinta waa la keydiyay.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Dhammaan goobaha ku jira qaybtan waxaa loo soo celiyay sidii hore.','Done.'=>'La dhammeeyey.','That action is not available.'=>'Tallaabadaas lama heli karo.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Feylkaas lama akhrin karo. Dooro feylinta dejinta ee laga dhoofiyay Zinn® plugin.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Feylkani waa mid aad u weyn oo aan noqon karin dhoofinta dejinta.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faylkaasi ma aha dhoofinta dejinta Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faylkaas waxa laga dhoofiyey furaha (%s) oo ka duwan, markaa soo dejintiisu waxay halkan ku kaydinaysaa dejinta uusan furahani fahmi karin.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d habeyn ayaa la keenay. Furayaasha sirta ah iyo furayaasha API-ga laguma daro dhoofinta, markaa kuwaas mar kale geli.' . "\0" . '%d goobaha la dhoofiyay. Furayaasha sirta ah iyo furayaasha API-ga laguma daro dhoofinta, markaa fadlan mar kale gali kuwaas.','Zinn Digital® did not return a token. Nothing has been changed on this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma soo celinin calaamad. Wax isbeddel ah laguma sameyn boggan.','This site is no longer connected to Zinn® media offload. New uploads will stay on this server. Pair it again from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Boggan mar dambe kuma xirna Zinn® media offload. Soo-gelinta cusub waxay ku sii sugnaan doontaa server-kan. Mar labaad ka lammaane dashboard-kaaga Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® answered with HTTP %d.'=>'Zinn Digital® waxay ku jawaabtay HTTP %d.','Disconnected by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Waxaa jaray Zinn Digital®.','Connected'=>'Ku xiran','Connecting…'=>'Waa la xiriirinayaa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Ku xiran, laakiin wax baa u baahan in laga fiirso','Not connected'=>'Lama xiriirin','Running on your own account'=>'Ka shaqaynaya akoonkaaga','We could not check this'=>'Waanu hubin kari waynay arrinkan','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Furitaankani ma uusan sheegin sababta. Dir warbixinta ogaanshaha cilladaha annaguna waan eegi doonaa.','Connection status'=>'Xaaladda xiriirka','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Waa la hubiyay %s kahor.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(wuxuu ku furmayaa tab cusub)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Tan u dir taageerada Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Tani waa waxa saxda ah ee la diri doono — wax kale ma jiro, waxna laguma qarin doono. Furayaashaada sirta ah, summadaha (tokens), iyo furayaasha API-ga kuma jiraan.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Warbixinta ogaanshaha cilladaha ee la diri doono','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nuuji galka kliibka','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'U dir warbixintaan taageerada Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Waxaan kuu fureynaa tikidh taageero ah oo aan iimayl kuugu soo jawaabeynaa. Haddii aadan jeclayn in aad dirtid, kor ka koobi oo adigu geli tikidh.','Copied'=>'La guuriyay','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Kama soo gaari kareynay Zinn Digital® server-kan (%s) ka socota. Koobi garee warbixinta kor ku xusan oo halkaas beddelkeeda fur tigidh — wax khalad ah kama jiraan dejintaada.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Taageerada Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada waxayna kuugu soo jawaabi doontaa iimayl.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Taageerada Zinn® waxay haysaa warbixintaada — tixraaca %s — waxayna kuugu soo jawaabi doontaa iimayl ahaan.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Waxaad dirtay warbixino dhowr ah waqti gaaban gudahood. Sug daqiiqado yar oona dib u day — kuwii hore way yimaadeen.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma awoodin inay aqbasho warbixinta hadda — taasi waa dhankayaga, ee maaha taada. Mar kale isku day dhawaan, ama nuqul ka yeel warbixinta sare oo geliy tigidh.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Warbixinta waa la diiday (HTTP %d). Koobi garso kore oo fur tigidh, adigoo xiganaya lambarkaas.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagaha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri buug-gacmeedka isticmaalaha ee %s','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Martigelinta Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kaydinta maalinlaha ah, haajiradda bilaashka ah iyo guddiga kontoroolka ee loogu talagalay dadka wada in ka badan hal bog.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi mareegaha la aas-aasay, domain-yada, iyo meelaynta xiriiriyeyaasha, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinac ay ka farxayaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan u shaqaysta xirfad ahaan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa caalamiga ah ee xorta ah: ka baadh in ka badan 10,000 oo adeeg oo diyaar ah oo ka yimid qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyeyaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u ogolow inay ku tartamaan.','Media Offload'=>'Weynaynta Warbaahinta','Connection'=>'Isku-xirka','What gets moved'=>'Waxa la raruayo','How media is served'=>'Sida warbaahinta loo adeegsado','Move a batch now'=>'Hadda u guuri xidhmo','Media already moved is never affected by a change here — its address does not change.'=>'Warbaahinta horay loo raray marnaba saameyn kuma yeelaneyso isbeddel halkan lagu sameeyo — cinwaankeedu ma beddelmo.','New uploads'=>'Soo-gelinta cusub','Move new uploads to Zinn® storage as they arrive'=>'U raran soo-gelinta cusub kaydinta Zinn® marka ay yimaadaan','Existing media'=>'Warbaahinta jirta','Keep moving the media library that is already here'=>'Sii wad dhaqaaqista maktabadda warbaahinta ee halkaan horey u joogta','A few files an hour, in the background, picking up where it left off. Turning this off pauses it; nothing already moved comes back.'=>'Dhowr fayl saacaddii, habka dambe, iyada oo ka billaabeysa meelii ay joogto. Deminta tani waxay joojinaysaa; wax horay loo raray dib uma soo noqonayaan.','Files per hourly pass'=>'Faylasha saacaddiiiba halkii mar','Each attachment is several files and every one is a full upload. Raise this on a fast host with a generous execution limit; lower it if passes are being cut short.'=>'Lifaaq kastaa waa dhowr fayl oo mid kastaa waa soo-gelin buuxda. Arrinkan ku kor u qaad bixiye adeeg oo degdeg ah oo leh xad fulineed oo deeqsi ah; hoos u dhig haddii soo-dhaafinnada la soo gaabinayo.','Leave files smaller than'=>'Ka tag faylasha ka yar inta','Kilobytes. A tiny icon costs more in the extra connection than it saves in disk, so there is rarely a reason to move one. Set to 0 to move everything.'=>'Kilobytes. Halkii icon yar ayaa ka kharash badan xiriirka dheeraadka ah ee ay ku badbaadineyso diskiga, markaa dhif ayey dhacdaa sabab loo guuro mid. U deji 0 si aad wax walba u guurtid.','Never move these types'=>'Abid waligeba ha dhaqaajin','Useful when a plugin reads a file straight off the disk — a font, a PDF a form builder stamps, an audio file a player seeks inside.'=>'Wax ku ool ah marka uu plugin-ku faylka si toos ah uga akhriyo diskiga — farta qoraalka, PDF uu sameeyay dhisaha foomamku, ama faylka codka ah ee ciyaartooygu dhex baadhayo.','These two are the ones to be careful with — read each description before changing it.'=>'Labadan waa kuwa laga taxaddarayo — akhriso sharraxaad kasta ka hor intaanad beddelin.','Serve from Zinn® storage'=>'Ka adeegso keydka Zinn®','Point image and file addresses at Zinn® storage'=>'Cinwaannada sawirrada iyo faylasha u jeedi kaydka Zinn®','Off, files are uploaded but still served from this server — which is the safe state while you check everything arrived. On, visitors are served from storage and this server stops carrying the traffic.'=>'Dami, faylasha waa la soo geliyay laakiin wali waxaa laga adeegayaa adeegean — kaas oo ah xaaladda nabdoon inta aad ka hubinayso in wax walba yimaadeen. Daaran, booqdayaasha waxaa laga adeegayaa meesha lagu keydiyo oo adeegehán wuxuu joojinayaa qaadista taraafikada.','Free the disk space'=>'Xoree booska diskiga','Delete the local copy once every size has uploaded'=>'Tirtir nuqulka maxalliga ah marka cabbir kasta la soo geliyo','This is the point of offloading, and it is also the irreversible half. Leave it off until “Serve from Zinn® storage” is on and you have checked your site — a local copy is the only thing that saves you if something was missed.'=>'Tani waa barta laga guurayo, waana qaybta aan la soo celin karin. U daa damin ilaa laga shido “Serve from Zinn® storage” oo aad hubiso mareegtaada — nuqul maxalli ah ayaa ah waxa kaliya ee ku badbaadinaya haddii wax la waayo.','Deleting local copies cannot be undone from this screen. Take a backup first — the Zinn® Connector plugin can do that for you.'=>'Nuqullada maxalliga ah ee la tirtiray lagama soo celin karo shaashadan. Samee kayd ilaa hore — Zinn® Connector plugin wuu kuu samayn karaa taas.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage yet, so there is nowhere to move media to.'=>'Boggani weli kuma xirna keydka Zinn®, markaa ma jiro meel warbaahinta loo guuro.','%d attachment moved.'=>'%d lifaaq ayaa la raray.' . "\0" . '%d lifaaq ayaa la raray.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage.'=>'Boggan kuma xidhna keydinta Zinn®.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Media stays on this server until it is.'=>'Wax khalad ah ma jiraan — si fudud weli lama lammaanin. Warbaahintu waxay ku sii sugnaan doontaa adeegetan ilaa inta laga lammaaninayo.','Connected, but the last upload failed.'=>'Waa la xirxiray, laakiin soo-gelintii ugu dambaysay waa ay fashilantay.','Try a batch now'=>'Hadda isku day dufcad','Connected. Every attachment has been moved.'=>'Ku xidhan. Lifaaq kasta waa la raray.','Connected. %1$s of %2$s attachments still on this server.'=>'Ku xidhan. %1$s oo ka mid ah %2$s lifaaqyo ayaa weli ku jira server-kan.','Moved so far'=>'Ilaa iyo hadda la raray','%1$s files, %2$s'=>'Faylasha %1$s, %2$s','Still on this server'=>'Weli server-kan ayuu ku jiraa','%1$s of %2$s attachments'=>'%1$s oo ah %2$s lifaaqyada','Served from'=>'Laga soo adeegay','this server'=>'serverkan','Connect this site'=>'Ku xidh boggan','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Storage → Media offload, and press “Pair a site”. Paste the code below.'=>'Furo guddkaaga maamulka ee Zinn Digital®, tag Storage → Media offload, kadibna riix “Pair a site”. Ku dheji koodhka hoose.','Pairing code'=>'Koodhka lammaanaha','Disconnect this site'=>'Ka jar goobtan','New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change.'=>'Soo-gelinta cusub waxay kuhaan doontaa server-kan. Warbaahinta horay loo raray waxay sii wadaysaa shaqada — cinwaankeedu ma beddelmayo.','You do not have permission to manage this site.'=>'Ma haysatid ogolaansho aad ku maamusho boggan.','Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Geli koodka lamaaneynta ee laga keenay dashboard-kaaga Zinn Digital®.','Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background.'=>'Xiran. Soo-gelinta cusub waxa hadda wixii ka dambeeya lagu keydin doonaa Zinn Digital®, warbaahintaadii horena waxay u guuri doontaa xagga dambe.','Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server.'=>'Waa la gooyay. Warbaahinta horay loo raray way shaqeyneysaa; soo-gelinta cusub waxay ku sii sugnaan doontaa server-kan.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'Feylkaas lagama akhrin karo adeegahan, markaa waxba lama soo gelin.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Goobtan kari wayday in ay baahiso soo-gelinta, markaa waxba lama dirin.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Feylkani waa %1$s oo PHP-ga boggan ma laha cURL, markaa inta ugu badan ee uu soo gelin karo waa %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'So dejinta lama soo gabagabeeyo karin.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Kaydku wuu diiday soo gelinta (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Habka muuqaalka','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Meel laga bilaabo. Wixii hoose ku yaal ayaa ka sarreeya.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Isticmaal midabadayda iyo cabirradayda','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Tan ha ka tagin oo hormayntu waa sidii loo isticmaalay.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiintii la soo dejiyey ayaa ku guuldareysatay baaritaanka hufnaanta waxaana la rakibay.']];